WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.256 --> 00:00:03.478
(guttural vocalizing)

00:00:03.478 --> 00:00:05.942
- [Melissa Cross] The
most powerful thing about

00:00:05.942 --> 00:00:07.501
being a metal singer,

00:00:07.501 --> 00:00:09.229
(guttural vocalizing)

00:00:09.229 --> 00:00:10.181
(guttural vocalizing)

00:00:10.181 --> 00:00:11.486
(guttural vocalizing)

00:00:11.486 --> 00:00:12.483
(guttural vocalizing)

00:00:12.483 --> 00:00:13.495
(guttural vocalizing)

00:00:13.495 --> 00:00:15.971
is the complete release

00:00:15.971 --> 00:00:17.766
(loud screaming)

00:00:17.766 --> 00:00:18.669
of passion.

00:00:18.669 --> 00:00:22.159
(guttural vocalizing)

00:00:22.159 --> 00:00:25.426
(loud metal rock music)

00:00:25.426 --> 00:00:27.759
I teach people how to scream

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:31.172
effectively without damage,

00:00:31.172 --> 00:00:32.748
but I'm also a singing teacher.

00:00:32.748 --> 00:00:34.744
(vocalizing harmonically)

00:00:34.744 --> 00:00:37.713
My background is Shakespeare and opera.

00:00:37.713 --> 00:00:39.433
(gentle vocalizing)

00:00:39.433 --> 00:00:41.497
I got known for being a scream teacher

00:00:41.497 --> 00:00:44.504
because I figured this out,

00:00:44.504 --> 00:00:45.337
and I'm glad I did,

00:00:45.337 --> 00:00:47.490
because everyone was trashing themselves.

00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:50.442
Instead of going reh-ahh, I
want (guttural vocalizing)

00:00:50.442 --> 00:00:53.690
(guttural vocalizing)

00:00:53.690 --> 00:00:57.292
Most metal kids, before they get trained,

00:00:57.292 --> 00:01:01.459
they think that the only way
that you can get that sound

00:01:02.392 --> 00:01:06.570
is to feel that way, and that's dangerous

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:09.994
because if you feel that way
when you make that sound,

00:01:09.994 --> 00:01:11.210
it hurts.

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:13.773
(guttural vocalizing)

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:16.661
Three, four, five, and release everything.

00:01:16.661 --> 00:01:19.511
I teach them the least
amount of effort to do it,

00:01:19.511 --> 00:01:22.135
and then they don't
trash their vocal chords.

00:01:22.135 --> 00:01:25.542
(guttural harmonizing)

00:01:25.542 --> 00:01:26.707
I want it seamless.

00:01:26.707 --> 00:01:29.469
(guttural harmonizing)

00:01:29.469 --> 00:01:32.719
Metal is, like, has a certain behavior,

00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:36.275
and it's about loyalty.

00:01:36.275 --> 00:01:37.261
It's real.

00:01:37.261 --> 00:01:40.928
(subdued metal rock music)

